# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEVER commit personal skills or persona content to this public repo.
# persona/ and any ~/.claude personal skills are user-level and must
# stay out. This is a shareable framework template — keep it clean of
# anything private, machine-specific, or identity-bound.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/persona/
*.local
.env*

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Generated flow-ledger bootstrap draft (review + rename to flow-ledger.yaml — never commit the draft)
production/flow-ledger.draft.yaml

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is the SOURCE of the framework, never an install of it.
# scripts/install.sh refuses to install into a directory holding
# manifest.yaml + skills/, so a .claude/ here can only be a stray
# copy that drifts against docs/. One did: a tracked
# .claude/docs/workflow-catalog.yaml kept globbing a retired path
# for a release after the source was fixed. Install into a game
# project to use the framework; never into this clone.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.claude/

# Scratch space for verification runs — never committed
/.scratch/

# Python bytecode from tools/ runners
__pycache__/
*.pyc
